This is a placeholder FMU file. In a real implementation, this would be a zip archive containing:
- modelDescription.xml (describing the model variables and structure)
- binaries/ directory with the compiled model code
- sources/ directory with the source code (optional)
- documentation/ directory (optional)

The actual FMU would need to be generated from the Simulink model (ev_cell_digital_twin.slx) using MATLAB's Simulink Compile FMU functionality or similar tools.